    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19631" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βᾰτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>passable, accessible,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς ὑποζυγίοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					4.6.17
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				924
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>An.</u>
				4.21.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.54
			</span></i>, al.; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βέβηλος</span>
			, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄβατος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.11
			</span></i>: metaph., <i>permissible,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				30.8
			</span></i>
			<u>Intr.</u>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>speeding,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πούς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					2.96
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				18.55
			</span></i>.</div>
